step Elder Stranglethorn Tiger
  tip Careful: Troll camps are close to the tiger area, and trolls can join a fight if you pull carelessly.
  kill 1085 quest 187                 -- Elder Stranglethorn Tiger

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Booty Bay

step Down to Booty Bay
  tip Follow the main road south the length of the jungle, past the Grom'gol turn-off, to Booty Bay on the southern cape.
  sethome "Booty Bay"                 -- Upstairs
  turnin 98463                        -- Nixxrax Fillamug, in the Salty Sailor Tavern; upstairs
  accept 213                          -- Kebok, upstairs
  accept 189                          -- Kebok, in the tavern
  vendor nearest
  accept 198                          -- Krazek, in the tavern; upstairs
  accept 201
  accept 616                          -- Krazek
  accept 605                          -- Crank Fizzlebub, inside
  getfp "Booty Bay"
  turnin 616                          -- Baron Revilgaz, upstairs in the tavern
  accept 578
  accept 575                          -- Drizzlik, by the bank; inside

step Large River Crocolisk Skin on the way
  along until q575
  collect 4053 quest 575

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The jungle loop
step Bal'lal Ruins: kill these as you meet them
  label q575
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip The Bloodscalp trolls hold the ruins on the coast west of Nesingwary's camp.
  tip Walk back north; the Crystalvein Mine lies west of the road in the middle of the jungle. The Crystal Spine Basilisks there drop the shards.
  collect 3918 quest 605              -- Singing Crystal Shard
  collect 4053 quest 575
  collect 1519 quest 189              -- Bloodscalp Ear
  level 35.1                          -- grind on Crystal Spine Basilisk

step Panthers, raptors and elder tigers
  tip Careful: The raptor nest has young raptors that join the fight when you attack the adults.
  kill 685 quest 194                  -- Stranglethorn Raptor

