step River crocolisks
  tip River Crocolisks swim the river by the Rebel Camp.
  collect 4053 quest 575              -- Large River Crocolisk Skin

step Private Thorsen
  tip Thorsen patrols the road north of camp, toward the Rebel Camp.
  turnin 198

